Sval: about:policies names each policy without linking Mozilla's docs

The Documentation tab linked each policy's name to
firefox-admin-docs.mozilla.org, which documents Firefox. The name is shown
as plain text, as on the Active tab.

diff --git a/browser/components/enterprisepolicies/content/aboutPolicies.js b/browser/components/enterprisepolicies/content/aboutPolicies.js
index 19c0b3dd6d..686e9303c9 100644
